mission "A Letter in the Main"
    name "A Letter in the Main"
    description "Deliver Ortez's letter to Judge Valera at Nueva Esperanza."
    source "Cormorant Quay"
    destination "Nueva Esperanza"
    reward 640
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "The Boom at Cormorant Quay: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A sealed letter from Magistrate Ortez must reach an honest judge in Nueva Esperanza.`
            `The letter names Ashcombe and the governors who signed the false charter. It asks the judge to protect witnesses travelling between the islands.`
            `The Spanish Main is more heavily patrolled than the outer islands. Keep the letter hidden and avoid unnecessary fights.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The Spanish Main is more heavily patrolled than the outer islands. Keep the letter hidden and avoid unnecessary fights.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Ortez gives you a brass seal to prove the letter is genuine. “The judge is cautious, but he still believes a law should mean something.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Letter in the Main. Deliver Ortez's letter to Judge Valera at Nueva Esperanza."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Judge Valera confirms the charter was issued under false authority. The Company has been paying Crown's Fall to conceal the original document.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Valera asks you to meet a former royal notary at Crown's Fall.`
        log "Completed A Letter in the Main. Received 640 gold. Valera asks you to meet a former royal notary at Crown's Fall."
